WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.667
( music playing )

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:05.083
Alex: Good morning.

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:07.875
I'm bringing you some sad
and upsetting news.

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:11.333
- First and foremost...
- Mitch: I am a journalist.

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:12.500
I can feel when
the world needs me.

00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:15.458
Alex: Because guess what.
America loves me.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.792
Bradley: I'm just here
to deliver the news to America.

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.166
That's-- that's
all I ever wanted to do.

00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:20.792
Cory:
People get their horrible news

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:21.834
delivered to the palm of their hand.

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:23.959
Alex: Don't you ever
question my integrity

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.166
in my own house again.

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:26.959
Mitch: I feel that people
are screaming

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.375
for an honest conversation.

00:00:28.417 --> 00:00:30.250
Alex: I can guarantee that you
are underestimating me.

00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:32.375
Bradley: I-- I think they want to know
the person behind the facade.

00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:34.875
- Mitch: I have to fight back.
- Alex: You're not listening!

00:00:34.917 --> 00:00:36.917
- Bradley: I push. It's just in my nature.
- Alex: You are part of this family.

00:00:36.959 --> 00:00:38.959
- Alex: I don't need to justify anything.
- Bradley: And they all want to be right,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.000
- and they all want to win.
- Cory: Well, that's just the world it is.

00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:42.458
- Alex: We are doing this my way.
- Bradley: I think they want to trust

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.959
that the person is telling them
the truth about the world

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.583
is an honest person.

